        "row_6": {
          "type": "row",
          "settings": {
            "title": "About this product",
            "content_source": "custom",
            "text": "<p>Night skincare usually gets dropped for one of two reasons: too many steps, or a retinol that feels too harsh to keep using.&nbsp;<br/><br/>This is one step. 0.2% retinol sits on a beef tallow base, with Ectoin and Stephania to keep skin calm. A pea-sized amount before bed, and that is your night routine.</p>",
            "open": false,
            "hide_on_mobile": false,
            "hide_on_desktop": false
          }
        },
        "row_7": {
          "type": "row",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How to use",
            "content_source": "custom",
            "text": "<p>1. At night, on a clean, dry face, take a pea-sized amount.<br/><br/>2. Dot it on forehead, cheeks and chin, then massage upward into the face and neck until absorbed.<br/><br/>3. New to retinol? Use it 2 to 3 nights a week for the first two weeks, then move to nightly. Always wear SPF 30 in the morning.</p>",
            "open": false,
            "hide_on_mobile": false,
            "hide_on_desktop": false
          }
        },
        "row_8": {
          "type": "row",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Ingredients",
            "content_source": "custom",
            "text": "<p>Key ingredients: Retinol 0.2%, beef tallow, Ectoin, Stephania Tetrandra Extract, Vitamin E, Sodium Hyaluronate, Glycerin, Jojoba Seed Oil, Shea Butter.<br/><br/>Full ingredient list:</p><p>Water, Glycerin, Adeps Bovis (Tallow), Simmondsia Chinensis (Jojoba) Seed Oil, Butyrospermum Parkii (Shea Butter), Cyclopentasiloxane, Dimethicone, Butylene Glycol, Cetyl Ethylhexanoate, Ceteth-20 Phosphate, Cetearyl Alcohol, Ceteth-20, Glyceryl Stearate, PEG-100 Stearate, Hydroxyacetophenone, 1,2-Hexanediol, Stephania Tetrandra Extract, Taraxacum Officinale (Dandelion) Leaf Extract, Saururus Chinensis Leaf/Root Extract, Allantoin, Tocopherol (Vitamin E), Carbomer, Arginine, Sodium Hyaluronate, Retinol, Ectoin.</p>",
            "open": false,
            "hide_on_mobile": false,
            "hide_on_desktop": false
          }
        },
        "row_9": {
          "type": "row",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Delivery and returns",
            "content_source": "custom",
            "text": "<p>Nationwide delivery, with Cash on Delivery available. Every order carries the Zenith Money-Back Guarantee. Full terms on our <a href=\"/policies/refund-policy\">Refunds and Returns</a> page.</p>",
            "open": false,
            "hide_on_mobile": false,
            "hide_on_desktop": false
          }
        },
        "row_10": {
          "type": "row",
          "settings": {
            "title": "FAQs",
            "content_source": "questions",
            "text": "<h3>Will the retinol make my skin peel?</h3><p>0.2% is a gentle retinol level, and the tallow base buffers it. New to retinol? Start 2 to 3 nights a week for the first two weeks, then go nightly. If anything feels wrong, stop and message us.</p><h3>Is it greasy with beef tallow in it?</h3><p>No. It absorbs fast and finishes light. No shine, no residue on the pillow.</p><h3>Does it smell like beef?</h3><p>No. The cream has a light, neutral scent.</p><h3>Do I still need sunscreen?</h3><p>Yes. Retinol makes skin more sensitive to the sun, so wear SPF 30 every morning. The Zenith Anti-Aging Tallow Day Cream SPF 30 is made for that.</p><h3>Can I use it with the Cleanser and the Day Cream?</h3><p>Yes. Cleanser morning and night, Day Cream SPF 30 in the morning, Tallow Cream at night. The directions are on every label.</p><h3>Paano kung hindi ako hiyang?</h3><p>Every order carries the Zenith Money-Back Guarantee. Skin products are covered for 30 days, counted from delivery.&nbsp;<br/><br/>Message us on Facebook or email <a href=\"mailto:hello@tryzenith.ph\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"mailto:hello@tryzenith.ph\">hello@tryzenith.ph</a> with your order number and a photo of the product. Full terms on our <a href=\"/policies/refund-policy\" title=\"Refunds and Returns\">Refunds and Returns</a> page.</p><p></p>",
            "open": false,
            "hide_on_mobile": false,
            "hide_on_desktop": false
          }
        }
      },
